function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

[an|] integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int")

[a|] boolean means: @intrinsic("type", "bool")

the choice of [{integer:value}|{boolean:value}] means: @intrinsic("select", @intrinsic("equal", 0, 0), value, value)

ignore the choice of 1
ignore the choice of @intrinsic("equal", 1, 1)
